; Multi-cluster G13 parts and two-die parts set the coherency bit of device
; atomics; single-die G14 parts (M2 Pro / Max) do not.
; MULTIDIE: atomic add, 0, r{{[0-9]+}}, u0_u1, 0, signed, r{{[0-9]+}}, 1
; ONEDIE: atomic add, 0, r{{[0-9]+}}, u0_u1, 0, signed, r{{[0-9]+}}, 0

